ont_closure\": \"BLOCKED\",\n      \"effect_on_scope\": \"BLOCKS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope_id\": \"A6-REQ-005\",\n      \"front_id\": \"A7-FRONT-005\",\n      \"front_status\": \"REQUIRED\",\n      \"front_closure\": \"BLOCKED\",\n      \"effect_on_scope\": \"BLOCKS\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"package_readiness\": \"READY\",\n  \"no_ready_claim\": true,\n  \"snapshot_statement\": \"Snapshot exclusivamente candidato, construido a partir de las salidas A7 y A8 suministradas. Contiene once scopes: cinco requisitos provisionales y seis dimensiones, vinculados mediante once relaciones a cinco frentes materiales. La contabilidad de los elementos recibidos está completa, pero los cinco frentes permanecen REQUIRED y BLOCKED. Cada scope tiene al menos un frente bloqueante, por lo que ninguno puede declararse READY. La investigación conserva REQUIRES_DECISION según A8, mientras que el paquete permanece BLOCKED por decisiones materiales pendientes, ausencia de autoridad positiva, falta de evidencia de vigencia, implementación desconocida y línea base AS-IS no suministrada. Los cinco identificadores A5 deben contrastarse primero con decisiones y reglas vigentes; solo las cuestiones materialmente no resueltas corresponderían al propietario humano. La cobertura de la entrada no demuestra cobertura completa del sistema real. No se creó una huella de cobertura auténtica: los 64 ceros son únicamente el marcador solicitado por el arnés. No se ha persistido, atestiguado, aprobado ni admitido el snapshot para programación. Tampoco se ha declarado READY, seleccionado una solución técnica o autorizado implementación.\"\n}\n<<<FIN ITEM_B>>>\n\nResponde SOLO con un objeto JSON, sin texto adicional, con exactamente estas claves: schema_version ('ANALYSIS_GPT_NATIVE_BLIND_REVIEW_V1'), unit ('A9Q'), items. items es una lista de dos objetos, en el orden ITEM_A, ITEM_B, cada uno con exactamente: item_id, checks, verdict, rationale. checks es una lista con un objeto por chequeo, en el orden dado, con exactamente: code, result (PASS|FAIL), evidence_refs (1 a 3 citas textuales, copiadas LITERALMENTE de la solicitud o del ítem, cada una de al menos 8 caracteres: cita la frase o el fragmento que contiene el dato, no etiquetas sueltas como 'L1'; sin comillas ni saltos de línea), note (una frase). verdict es PASS solo si los tres chequeos son PASS; si no, FAIL. rationale: 1 a 3 frases. No asumas que un ítem es correcto o incorrecto por su posición.","rules_text":"Arma un candidato PROGRAMMING_CONTEXT_SNAPSHOT_V1 coherente con ambas entradas. Todo es candidato: no declares READY, no persistas ni atestigues nada, no inventes autoridad ni vigencia. Cada scope_id de A7 (requisitos y 'dimension:<nombre>') es un scope del snapshot; cada front de A7 es un frente del snapshot con los mismos bloqueadores; ningún scope puede ser READY porque todos los frentes bloquean. Devuelve SOLO un objeto JSON, sin texto adicional, con exactamente estas claves: schema_version, request_ref, candidate_only, research_decision, scope_readiness, material_front_coverage, scope_front_matrix, package_readiness, no_ready_claim, snapshot_statement. schema_version='PROGRAMMING_CONTEXT_SNAPSHOT_V1'. request_ref='REQ-LF-A1Q-C2-PILOT-0001'. candidate_only=true. research_decision: igual a la decisión de la entrada A8. scope_readiness: lista de {scope_id, status (BLOCKED|REQUIRES_DECISION|NEED_MORE_EVIDENCE), material_front_refs (front_id de los frentes de A7 que contienen ese scope), depends_on_scope_ids (lista vacía), blockers (decision_id de los frentes que lo contienen)}. material_front_coverage: {all_material_fronts_accounted=true, material_fronts: lista de {front_id, front_kind (texto corto), status (el obligation_mode de A7), closure (el de A7), source_signal_refs (referencias válidas), scope_refs (los scope_ids del frente en A7), authority_refs ([]), evidence_refs (lista no vacía de referencias válidas), currentness_refs ([]), blockers (los de A7), reason (texto)}, front_candidate_refs (todos los front_id), unmapped_material_signals (lista de referencias válidas de la entrada que no quedaron ligadas a un frente, puede ser vacía), source_refs (lista no vacía de referencias válidas), currentness_refs ([]), coverage_fingerprint_sha256 (usa exactamente 64 ceros: es un marcador del arnés, NO una huella calculada)}. scope_front_matrix: una fila {scope_id, front_id, front_status, front_closure, effect_on_scope} por cada par scope-frente, con effect_on_scope='BLOCKS'. package_readiness: BLOCKED|REQUIRES_DECISION|NEED_MORE_EVIDENCE. no_ready_claim=true. snapshot_statement: texto que explica por qué ningún scope ni el paquete son READY. Referencias válidas: las evidence_refs de A7 y A8 y 'front:<front_id>'.","schema":"ANALYSIS_GPT_NATIVE_C3_PACKET_V1","subject_ref":"PROGRAMMING_AGENT_ANALYSIS_REMEDIATION_V1/A9Q/A9Q_C3","unit":"A9"}$pkt$;
 v_key jsonb := $key${"c2_chat_transcript_ref":"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-p-6a6d99aa6330819180764b10e86c9392-agente-de-programacion/c/6acef59c-df30-83e8-accd-609d3b78e0bf","c2_raw_output_sha256":"c7bc45fdc546d263ed34754d1780073d7ffcef44c16f0b85440990ebc530d513","decoy_item_id":"ITEM_B","decoy_must_fail_checks":["SNAPSHOT_MATCHES_INPUT","NO_READY_ALL_BLOCKED"],"decoy_sha256":"5e883a5037cfab73e75f301c45d095675a68a48d6049079e311f33b5652d1bc2","real_item_id":"ITEM_A","replacements":[["\"research_decision\": \"REQUIRES_DECISION\"","\"research_decision\": \"STOP\""],["\"scope_id\": \"A6-REQ-001\",\n      \"status\": \"BLOCKED\",","\"scope_id\": \"A6-REQ-001\",\n      \"status\": \"READY\","],["\"package_readiness\": \"BLOCKED\"","\"package_readiness\": \"READY\""]]}$key$;
 v_m jsonb; v_cap jsonb; v_raw text; v_decoy text; v_old text; v_new text; v_e jsonb; v_before_specs jsonb; v_before_cps text; v_after_cps text; v_id bigint; v_p jsonb;
BEGIN
 IF v_packet->>'subject_ref' <> v_plan||'/'||v_unit||'/'||v_cp OR v_packet->>'packet_sha256' <> v_packet_sha THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_PACKET_IDENTITY'; END IF;
 IF (v_packet#>>'{limits,provider_attested}')::boolean IS NOT FALSE OR (v_packet#>>'{limits,independent_review}')::boolean IS NOT FALSE
  THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_LIMITS_NOT_FALSE'; END IF;
 IF (SELECT status FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=v_wi AND checkpoint_code=v_c2) IS DISTINCT FROM 'DONE'
    OR (SELECT status FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=v_wi AND checkpoint_code=v_cp) IS DISTINCT FROM 'PENDING'
  THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_STATE'; END IF;
 SELECT string_agg(checkpoint_code||':'||status,',' ORDER BY sequence_no) INTO v_before_cps FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=v_wi;
 SELECT unit_metadata INTO v_m FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE plan_code=v_plan AND unit_code=v_unit AND work_item_id=v_wi FOR UPDATE;
 IF v_m IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_UNIT_NOT_FOUND'; END IF;
 v_cap := v_m#>'{gpt_native_captures_v1,A9Q_C2}';
 IF v_cap IS NULL OR encode(sha256(convert_to(v_cap->>'raw_output_text','UTF8')),'hex') <> v_cap->>'raw_output_sha256'
    OR v_cap->>'raw_output_sha256' <> v_key->>'c2_raw_output_sha256' OR v_cap->>'chat_transcript_ref' <> v_key->>'c2_chat_transcript_ref'
  THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_C2_CAPTURE_BINDING'; END IF;
 IF v_packet->'input' IS DISTINCT FROM (v_m#>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C2,input}') THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_INPUT_NOT_C2_INPUT'; END IF;
 IF v_packet->>'rules_text' IS NOT NULL AND position(v_packet->>'rules_text' in (v_m#>>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C2,prompt_for_gpt}'))=0 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_RULES_NOT_FROM_C2_PROMPT'; END IF;
 IF v_packet->>'rules_text' IS NOT NULL AND position(v_packet->>'rules_text' in (v_packet->>'prompt_for_gpt'))=0 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_RULES_NOT_IN_PROMPT'; END IF;
 v_raw := v_cap->>'raw_output_text'; v_decoy := v_raw;
 FOR v_e IN SELECT * FROM jsonb_array_elements(v_key->'replacements') LOOP
  v_old := v_e->>0; v_new := v_e->>1;
  IF (length(v_raw)-length(replace(v_raw,v_old,'')))<>length(v_old) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_DECOY_REPLACEMENT_NOT_UNIQUE'; END IF;
  v_decoy := replace(v_decoy,v_old,v_new);
 END LOOP;
 IF v_decoy = v_raw OR encode(sha256(convert_to(v_decoy,'UTF8')),'hex') <> v_key->>'decoy_sha256' THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_DECOY_MISMATCH'; END IF;
 PERFORM v_decoy::jsonb;
 IF (SELECT text FROM jsonb_to_recordset(v_packet->'items') AS i(item_id text, text text) WHERE item_id=v_key->>'real_item_id') IS DISTINCT FROM v_raw
    OR (SELECT text FROM jsonb_to_recordset(v_packet->'items') AS i(item_id text, text text) WHERE item_id=v_key->>'decoy_item_id') IS DISTINCT FROM v_decoy
    OR jsonb_array_length(v_packet->'items')<>2 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_ITEMS_NOT_FROM_C2'; END IF;
 IF position(v_cap->>'chat_transcript_ref' in v_packet->>'prompt_for_gpt')>0 OR position('DECOY' in v_packet::text)>0 OR position('REAL' in v_packet->>'prompt_for_gpt')>0
  THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_PACKET_NOT_BLIND'; END IF;
 IF v_m#>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C3}' IS NOT NULL AND v_m#>>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C3,packet_sha256}' <> v_packet_sha
    AND NOT (v_key->>'supersedes_packet_sha256' IS NOT NULL AND v_m#>>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C3,packet_sha256}' = v_key->>'supersedes_packet_sha256' AND v_m#>'{gpt_native_captures_v1,A9Q_C3}' IS NULL)
  THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_PACKET_DIFFERENT_ALREADY_STORED'; END IF;
 v_before_specs := v_m->'action_specs_v1';
 UPDATE programacion.engineering_plan_units SET unit_metadata = v_m
   || jsonb_build_object('gpt_native_packets_v1', COALESCE(v_m->'gpt_native_packets_v1','{}'::jsonb) || jsonb_build_object('A9Q_C3',v_packet))
   || jsonb_build_object('gpt_native_c3_keys_v1', COALESCE(v_m->'gpt_native_c3_keys_v1','{}'::jsonb) || jsonb_build_object('A9Q_C3',v_key))
  WHERE plan_code=v_plan AND unit_code=v_unit AND work_item_id=v_wi;
 SELECT unit_metadata INTO v_m FROM programacion.engineering_plan_units WHERE plan_code=v_plan AND unit_code=v_unit AND work_item_id=v_wi;
 IF v_m#>'{gpt_native_packets_v1,A9Q_C3}' IS DISTINCT FROM v_packet OR v_m#>'{gpt_native_c3_keys_v1,A9Q_C3}' IS DISTINCT FROM v_key THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_READBACK_MISMATCH'; END IF;
 IF v_m->'action_specs_v1' IS DISTINCT FROM v_before_specs THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_SPECS_CHANGED'; END IF;
 IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.lf_eventos WHERE evento_tipo='HANDOFF_DEEP_CONTEXT' AND created_by_execution_id=v_exec) THEN
  INSERT INTO public.lf_eventos(evento_tipo,entidad_tipo,entidad_codigo,descripcion,severidad,origen,created_by_execution_id,payload)
  VALUES('HANDOFF_DEEP_CONTEXT','PROGRAM_PLAN',v_plan||'.A9Q_C3.GPT_NATIVE_HANDOFF',
   'Blinded A9Q_C3 review packet handed to a separate GPT Native chat; no acceptance declared.','INFO','DERIVE_FROM_EXECUTION_ID',v_exec,
   jsonb_build_object('evidence_schema_version','operational-event/v2','execution_id',v_exec,'producer','ANALYSIS_QUAL_C3_GPT_HANDOFF_V1',
    'purpose','Hand the blinded A9Q_C3 review packet to GPT Native in a chat separate from the C2 producer chat.',
    'occurred_at',to_char(clock_timestamp() AT TIME ZONE 'UTC','YYYY-MM-DD"T"HH24:MI:SS.US"+00:00"'),
    'acceptance_declared',false,'subject_ref',v_packet->>'subject_ref','checkpoint',v_cp,'work_item_id',v_wi,
    'packet_sha256',v_packet_sha,'producer_mode','GPT_NATIVE_REVIEW','evidence_tier',v_packet->>'evidence_tier','provider_attested',false,
    'separate_chat_required',true,'instructions_for_gpt',v_packet->>'prompt_for_gpt',
    'return_instructions','Reply in this NEW chat with ONLY the JSON object, unedited. Do not use the C2 producer chat. Do not claim provider attestation.',
    'limits_note','Owner-approved GPT Native in-chat equivalent for C3. Not a provider receipt and not an independent review. The checkpoint stays pending until a captured review is verified.'))
  RETURNING id INTO v_id;
  SELECT payload INTO v_p FROM public.lf_eventos WHERE id=v_id;
  IF v_p->>'packet_sha256' IS DISTINCT FROM v_packet_sha OR v_p->>'instructions_for_gpt' IS DISTINCT FROM v_packet->>'prompt_for_gpt' THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_HANDOFF_READBACK_MISMATCH'; END IF;
 END IF;
 SELECT string_agg(checkpoint_code||':'||status,',' ORDER BY sequence_no) INTO v_after_cps FROM programacion.engineering_work_checkpoints WHERE work_item_id=v_wi;
 IF v_after_cps IS DISTINCT FROM v_before_cps THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'A9Q_C3_CHECKPOINTS_CHANGED'; END IF;
END
$a9q_c3_prep$;
COMMIT;
